/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 54 0 R
/T (variables and calendar information. Rather than treating the project as a complete climate-change forecasting system, this work is best understood as a machine-learning prediction study on a historical time series.)
/E (variables and calendar information. Rather than treating the project as a complete climate-change forecasting system, this work is best understood as a machine-learning prediction study on a historical time series.)
