85 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 54 0 R
/T (   The prediction target is land surface temperature \(`t2m` in the source dataset\). The model uses surface pressure, precipitation, wind characteristics, and temporal features such as hour, month, quarter, day of week, and year.The project also compares several model families to determine whether nonlinear ensemble methods provide an advantage over a simple linear baseline.)
/E (   The prediction target is land surface temperature \(`t2m` in the source dataset\). The model uses surface pressure, precipitation, wind characteristics, and temporal features such as hour, month, quarter, day of week, and year.The project also compares several model families to determine whether nonlinear ensemble methods provide an advantage over a simple linear baseline.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
