<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (         Calendar features were extracted from the timestamp: hour, day of week, month, quarter, and year. The wind components were transformed into wind speed using the magnitude of the two components and into wind direction using the project's directional calculation. The final modeling dataset contains the following features: hour, day of week, month, quarter, year, wind speed, wind direction, surface pressure, and precipitation. Land surface temperature is the target.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
