310 0 obj
<<
/Title (The prediction plots in the notebook show that the Random Forest generally follows the observed temperature pattern in the test period, although there are intervals where predictions do not fully capture the observed variation. This suggests useful generalization while also showing that prediction errors remain.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 346 0 R
/Next 273 0 R
>>
